      "widgets_values": [
        "EXACTLY five boys aged 11 to 12 from Kerala standing in a ragged line on a muddy paddy-field pitch, no sixth person, no extra people, five people only. The first four boys' faces and identities EXACTLY like their reference images in order - reference image 1 = first boy, reference image 2 = second boy, reference image 3 = third boy, reference image 4 = fourth boy - all four faces clearly different, matching their references, four different heights. They wear mismatched faded football jerseys: red, green goalkeeper's with gloves, yellow, white - none of the kits matching, no black, some in rubber sandals. A hand-painted bedsheet banner with a round open-hand emblem hanging from two bamboo poles behind them. Wet green paddy and coconut palms behind, low golden late-afternoon light, shot like a documentary still, natural skin texture with no smoothing, soft honest lighting, shallow depth of field, subtle film grain, true-to-life colour",
        "Photorealistic documentary still of a Kerala village football team. True-to-life skin texture, natural light, no smoothing, no stylization, no cartoon, no illustration.",
